# --- Line-ending policy ---
# This repo is historically MIXED-EOL (many .py are CRLF in the worktree, a few
# are CRLF even in HEAD). We deliberately do NOT force a repo-wide normalization
# here -- that would rewrite ~24 unrelated files and bury real changes. This pins
# ONLY the two files whose Stage-3 edits had a CRLF-worktree vs LF-HEAD mismatch
# (audit finding F1), so their commits show functional changes, not a full flip.
# A repo-wide LF normalization can be done later as its own dedicated change.
face_service/config.py    text eol=lf
face_service/service.py   text eol=lf

# --- Binary assets: never apply line-ending or text diffing ---
*.npz              binary
*.png              binary
*.jpg              binary
*.jpeg             binary
requirements.lock  binary
